# Vendored third-party skill reference docs used by the build agent
# to assemble .claude/skills/ (base-mcp, build-on-base, vibenet), not
# Vouch402's own code — kept local only. See DECISION_LOG.md.
# .claude/ itself (skills, commands, settings) is intentionally NOT
# ignored: it's tracked and public so a fresh clone gets working
# Claude Code skill auto-discovery, and every SKILL.md in it is
# audited for content safety before being committed — see
# DECISION_LOG.md, 2026-09-17.
.agents/

# Same reasoning as .agents/ above, for a different tool: Aider's own
